    "text": "UML class diagram of the Dataset profile: one class, DatasetPackage, specialising Software/Package. It makes inherited properties mandatory (builtTime, originatedBy, releaseTime, downloadLocation, primaryPurpose, each [1]) and adds anonymizationMethodUsed, confidentialityLevel, dataCollectionProcess, dataPreprocessing, datasetAvailability, datasetNoise, datasetSize, datasetType DatasetType[1], datasetUpdateMechanism, hasSensitivePersonalInformation, intendedUse, knownBias and sensor. Enumerations: ConfidentialityLevelType, DatasetAvailabilityType, DatasetType.",
